#: ../../index.md:22 9ca240847a0a4ac1aafec329c50f6a8e
msgid ""
"GWexpy extends [GWpy](https://gwpy.github.io/) with matrix and field "
"containers, integrated noise-budget and modelling tools, and broad detector "
"interoperability."
msgstr ""
"GWexpy は [GWpy](https://gwpy.github.io/) "
"を拡張し、行列・場コンテナ、統合的なノイズバジェット・モデリングツール、幅広い検出器間の相互運用性を提供します。"

#: ../../index.md:105
